WEBVTT

00:05.150 --> 00:07.190
<b>Hey, Brother?</b>

00:07.980 --> 00:12.490
<b>Why do we have to wear something
cumbersome like underwear?</b>

00:12.650 --> 00:17.410
<b>According to the records, humans lived
while covering up their groins.</b>

00:17.530 --> 00:20.080
<b>So just be quiet and wear them, Eve.</b>

00:20.200 --> 00:25.960
<b>All right.
But why do I have to eat this plant?</b>

00:26.210 --> 00:30.630
<b>We machine lifeforms can move
without eating something like this.</b>

00:31.170 --> 00:36.930
<b>Apparently mankind gained
great intelligence from consuming this fruit.</b>

00:37.260 --> 00:40.140
<b>Stop whining and eat quietly.</b>

00:40.140 --> 00:44.480
<b>All right. If you say so, I will eat it.</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:50.070
<b>But when I'm done eating this,
will you play with me?</b>

00:50.900 --> 00:52.030
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:53.280 --> 00:55.950
<b>Then I'll do my best to eat lots.</b>

02:40.430 --> 02:42.180
<b>Stop with that voice.</b>

02:42.180 --> 02:47.390
<b>I mean, YoRHa is still
an elite squadron, right? And they...</b>

02:47.770 --> 02:50.140
<b>ask us to run a delivery errand.</b>

02:50.690 --> 02:55.110
<b>Since when do we run errands
for the Resistance?</b>

02:55.110 --> 02:56.940
<b>It's important to build up a partnership</b>

02:56.940 --> 03:00.150
<b>with the Resistance
as long as we're operating on land.</b>

03:00.240 --> 03:01.910
<b>So don't complain.</b>

03:02.200 --> 03:03.620
<b>Okay.</b>

03:04.030 --> 03:07.490
<b>If the mission was to simply deliver,
I wouldn't complain.</b>

03:07.490 --> 03:08.620
<b>Besides...</b>

03:09.870 --> 03:12.500
<b>Errands are safer than combat.</b>

03:12.920 --> 03:16.300
<b>It’s better not to die than to die.</b>

03:16.800 --> 03:19.050
<b>You're right.</b>

03:20.010 --> 03:21.590
<b>By the way, 2B.</b>

03:21.590 --> 03:26.680
<b>People who know me well
usually call me "Nines."</b>

03:26.850 --> 03:28.430
<b>So don't you think it's time?</b>

03:28.430 --> 03:29.600
<b>For what?</b>

03:29.600 --> 03:32.810
<b>Well, if you want to call me Nines,
it's totally okay.</b>

03:33.520 --> 03:35.190
<b>Not yet.</b>

03:35.440 --> 03:37.400
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

03:37.480 --> 03:40.490
<b><i>Report. Approaching target location.</i></b>

03:53.710 --> 03:55.170
<b>This building...</b>

03:55.540 --> 03:59.550
<b><i>Analysis. A commercial structure
used by humans.</i></b>

03:59.880 --> 04:02.550
<b><i>Called a "shopping center,"
it was a facility where a diverse array</i></b>

04:01.510 --> 04:06.050
<b>SHOPPING CENTER</b>

04:02.550 --> 04:06.050
<b><i>of merchandise,
including sundries, were on sale.</i></b>

04:06.220 --> 04:09.720
<b>I see, so it was something humans used.</b>

04:10.980 --> 04:12.100
<b>This is...</b>

04:12.520 --> 04:14.520
<b>A stick with something fluffy on it.</b>

04:14.520 --> 04:15.600
<b>What is this?</b>

04:15.600 --> 04:17.270
<b>Humans used things like this?</b>

04:17.400 --> 04:18.900
<b>What is this box?</b>

04:19.110 --> 04:21.150
<b>- Could this be...
- 9S.</b>

04:21.440 --> 04:22.740
<b>We're in the middle of a mission.</b>

04:22.990 --> 04:24.950
<b>Don't you have any interest, 2B?</b>

04:24.950 --> 04:27.580
<b>What kind of lives humans had lived...</b>

04:27.580 --> 04:29.200
<b>Oh, please hold on a second.</b>

04:29.200 --> 04:31.500
<b>I'll go. I said I'll go.</b>

04:33.960 --> 04:39.130
<b>But if you could shop with various items
in front of you, I'm sure it would be fun.</b>

04:39.210 --> 04:41.050
<b>We have no need for that.</b>

04:41.050 --> 04:42.760
<b>That's not necessarily true.</b>

04:42.760 --> 04:47.510
<b>If we annihilate the machine lifeforms,
we soldiers will no longer have anything to do.</b>

04:47.760 --> 04:49.100
<b>When that happens...</b>

04:50.260 --> 04:53.100
<b>I'm sure days where we
live peacefully will arrive.</b>

04:55.560 --> 04:56.400
<b>I know.</b>

04:56.650 --> 04:59.980
<b>When we gain peace,
let's go shopping together.</b>

04:59.980 --> 05:02.990
<b>I'll buy you T-shirts that look good on you.</b>

05:02.990 --> 05:04.320
<b>T-shirts...</b>

05:04.860 --> 05:07.160
<b>The clothing we have now is plenty.</b>

05:07.360 --> 05:12.450
<b>No, it's not about the clothing themselves,
but how we go shopping together sounds fun.</b>

05:12.450 --> 05:14.660
<b>Emotions are prohibited.</b>

05:15.870 --> 05:19.880
<b>Hearing those words
that are so characteristic of you satisfies me.</b>

05:19.880 --> 05:24.380
<b><i>Alert. Confirming multiple
machine lifeform signals up ahead.</i></b>

05:30.550 --> 05:33.930
<b>MACHINE LIFEFORM’S VILLAGE</b>

05:43.400 --> 05:44.740
<b><i>Please wait.</i></b>

05:44.740 --> 05:47.110
<b><i>P-Please put your weapons away.</i></b>

05:47.490 --> 05:50.200
<b><i>We are not your enemies.</i></b>

05:50.280 --> 05:52.910
<b><i>We have no intentions of fighting you.</i></b>

05:52.910 --> 05:54.750
<b><i>Stop. Don't kill me.</i></b>

05:54.750 --> 05:57.160
<b><i>- Yes, yes.
- I surrender. I surrender.</i></b>

05:57.460 --> 05:59.670
<b><i>We are not your enemies.</i></b>

06:01.790 --> 06:03.380
<b>Fine.</b>

06:04.300 --> 06:06.340
<b>You are Pascal?</b>

06:06.340 --> 06:09.550
<b><i>Oh, yes. That is correct.</i></b>

06:09.550 --> 06:12.430
<b>We came here because Lily
asked us to deliver this to you.</b>

06:12.930 --> 06:14.770
<b><i>From Lily?</i></b>

06:14.770 --> 06:16.640
<b>Are you being serious?</b>

06:16.640 --> 06:19.400
<b>Yeah. Though they are machine lifeforms,</b>

06:19.400 --> 06:22.860
<b>the units in that area
have no animosity against us.</b>

06:23.110 --> 06:24.690
<b>We’ve had interactions in the past.</b>

06:25.070 --> 06:26.240
<b>Interactions.</b>

06:26.240 --> 06:29.860
<b>They excel at work
more detailed than what we can do.</b>

06:29.860 --> 06:33.160
<b>In exchange, we provide them
with oil and minerals.</b>

06:33.370 --> 06:35.200
<b>I guess you'd call it a form of commerce.</b>

06:35.450 --> 06:36.830
<b>Commerce.</b>

06:36.830 --> 06:37.960
<b>Isn't that dangerous?</b>

06:38.120 --> 06:41.580
<b>At the least,
we haven’t been harmed yet.</b>

06:41.750 --> 06:44.460
<b>What they seek is not combat...</b>

06:44.630 --> 06:45.710
<b>but peace.</b>

06:47.050 --> 06:50.630
<b>If you can't believe me,
you can go see for yourselves.</b>

06:51.260 --> 06:54.050
<b>I'm sure they’ll greet you
by waving white flags.</b>

06:55.850 --> 07:01.350
<b><i>Once again, my name is Pascal.
I'm the leader of this village.</i></b>

07:01.560 --> 07:03.440
<b>A machine lifeform is...</b>

07:03.520 --> 07:11.700
<b><i>Thank you for the oil. You arrived
4,782 seconds earlier than we had expected.</i></b>

07:11.990 --> 07:15.410
<b>I heard that you've had interactions
with the Resistance in the past.</b>

07:15.410 --> 07:16.160
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

07:16.450 --> 07:21.620
<b><i>Lily understands us in our state,
and is very good to us.</i></b>

07:21.960 --> 07:24.630
<b>A machine lifeform
can converse to this extent?</b>

07:24.630 --> 07:25.630
<b><i>Oh.</i></b>

07:25.630 --> 07:29.880
<b><i>My hobby is reading books, so naturally,
my linguistic functions would improve.</i></b>

07:30.220 --> 07:35.970
<b>If you can speak that fluently, it must be
quite easy to gain the Resistance's trust.</b>

07:36.350 --> 07:43.310
<b><i>I cannot blame you for doubting, as we
have been fighting each other for a while now.</i></b>

07:44.020 --> 07:45.020
<b><i>However...</i></b>

07:45.400 --> 07:49.900
<b><i>Those that are here
have fled from such warfare.</i></b>

07:50.610 --> 07:56.030
<b><i>We currently are not connected
to the machine lifeform network.</i></b>

07:56.450 --> 08:00.290
<b><i>If you would like,
please try to interact with the others.</i></b>

08:01.120 --> 08:05.290
<b><i>After all, the only way to understand someone
is to get to know them.</i></b>

08:05.960 --> 08:08.550
<b><i>Isn’t that right?</i></b>

08:09.420 --> 08:10.630
<b>Interactions, huh?</b>

08:10.970 --> 08:15.470
<b>Is it serious? Is it saying that
knowing what our mission is?</b>

08:15.930 --> 08:18.680
<b>The true intent of that
machine lifeform is unknown.</b>

08:18.810 --> 08:21.310
<b>We do have the option
of simply returning right now.</b>

08:22.020 --> 08:25.310
<b>Our mission
is to investigate machine lifeforms.</b>

08:25.560 --> 08:29.860
<b>If they have no animosity, let's make
good use of that as much as we can.</b>

08:30.480 --> 08:36.120
<b><i>Go on, take a look. Dented metal plates,
warped coils, and worn out screws.</i></b>

08:36.120 --> 08:36.910
<b><i>I want this one.</i></b>

08:36.910 --> 08:40.370
<b><i>How long are you going to coop
yourself up in there? Come out already.</i></b>

08:40.950 --> 08:42.000
<b>This place...</b>

08:42.330 --> 08:48.920
<b><i>Hypothesis. Countless machine lifeforms
have gathered to create a form of community.</i></b>

08:49.130 --> 08:52.090
<b><i>This form is called a "village."</i></b>

08:52.510 --> 08:55.050
<b>A village of machine lifeforms...</b>

08:55.050 --> 08:57.180
<b><i>No precedents exist to this day...</i></b>

08:57.340 --> 08:58.220
<b><i>Oh.</i></b>

08:58.850 --> 09:01.310
<b><i>What is this. It's so cute.</i></b>

09:01.930 --> 09:02.310
<b>Hey!</b>

09:02.310 --> 09:07.440
<b><i>You guys are androids, right?
I've never seen one before.</i></b>

09:07.440 --> 09:09.270
<b>Oh, um...</b>

09:09.270 --> 09:12.740
<b><i>Alert. Requesting immediate release
of this unit.</i></b>

09:12.740 --> 09:15.740
<b><i>If this warning is ignored,
attack will commence in five seconds.</i></b>

09:15.740 --> 09:18.030
<b>Pod. Attacks are unauthorized.</b>

09:19.370 --> 09:20.530
<b>I unauthorize as well.</b>

09:21.620 --> 09:24.330
<b><i>Hey, can you take those blindfolds off?</i></b>

09:24.330 --> 09:26.120
<b>No, we can't.</b>

09:26.120 --> 09:27.830
<b><i>Why? Why not?</i></b>

09:27.830 --> 09:29.080
<b>It's our rules.</b>

09:29.080 --> 09:30.880
<b><i>What are rules?</i></b>

09:30.880 --> 09:33.630
<b>To put it in simple words,
it's like a promise.</b>

09:33.630 --> 09:34.630
<b><i>Promise.</i></b>

09:34.880 --> 09:37.840
<b><i>My big sister told me.</i></b>

09:38.180 --> 09:41.010
<b><i>You have to keep promises.</i></b>

09:41.100 --> 09:43.520
<b><i>Oh. So this is where you were.</i></b>

09:43.720 --> 09:45.350
<b><i>Oh. Big sister.</i></b>

09:45.350 --> 09:47.850
<b><i>Jeez, I was looking for you.</i></b>

09:47.850 --> 09:51.690
<b><i>I told you we were going
into the forest together today.</i></b>

09:51.940 --> 09:55.400
<b><i>I'm sorry she troubled you.</i></b>

09:55.400 --> 09:56.950
<b><i>Now, let's go.</i></b>

09:57.110 --> 09:57.910
<b><i>Yeah.</i></b>

10:01.080 --> 10:06.540
<b><i>Thank you for talking to me.
I'll see you again. Promise.</i></b>

10:06.790 --> 10:10.460
<b>Thank you? What exactly is going on?</b>

10:10.460 --> 10:12.670
<b>This is making me lose my bearings.</b>

10:12.800 --> 10:14.170
<b><i>Not over there.</i></b>

10:14.420 --> 10:15.670
<b><i>It’s dangerous.</i></b>

10:15.670 --> 10:17.720
<b><i>Let's play over here.</i></b>

10:19.220 --> 10:21.510
<b>Is there another village underground?</b>

10:35.190 --> 10:36.360
<b>This place...</b>

10:51.000 --> 10:53.920
<b>Some kind of head, perhaps?</b>

10:54.460 --> 10:56.130
<b>Why is it inside a tree?</b>

10:57.130 --> 11:00.550
<b><i>Report. Faint signal detected from target.</i></b>

11:00.550 --> 11:02.800
<b>Huh? Does that mean it's still alive?</b>

11:03.220 --> 11:06.640
<b><i>However, the signal differs
from that of a machine lifeform.</i></b>

11:06.640 --> 11:08.560
<b>It's not a machine lifeform?</b>

11:08.890 --> 11:10.390
<b>What is it?</b>

11:11.480 --> 11:12.940
<b>I kind of want to find out.</b>

11:13.650 --> 11:15.900
<b>I'm going to check it out a bit.</b>

11:15.900 --> 11:18.070
<b>I don't know if it's
a machine or an organic lifeform,</b>

11:18.070 --> 11:21.910
<b>but if there's a radio signal,
that means I can peek into its information.</b>

11:22.030 --> 11:24.070
<b>Careless contact is dangerous.</b>

11:24.070 --> 11:26.200
<b>It's fine. Leave this to me.</b>

11:26.490 --> 11:29.750
<b>Investigating in times like this
is the work for Scanner models.</b>

11:29.750 --> 11:32.580
<b>You could call it a true pleasure,
or a hobby.</b>

11:33.540 --> 11:34.710
<b>Hacking in.</b>

11:51.440 --> 11:54.060
<b>What’s this data space?</b>

11:54.770 --> 11:56.520
<b>I've never seen anything like it before.</b>

12:20.420 --> 12:24.300
<b><i>Report. Access shutdown forcibly
from the system side.</i></b>

12:24.300 --> 12:26.260
<b>Th-That surprised me.</b>

12:26.260 --> 12:28.970
<b>That's why I told you to not do it.</b>

12:29.520 --> 12:34.190
<b>But in return, I was able to read some data,
though only for an instant.</b>

12:34.600 --> 12:38.570
<b>It seems like this is a weapon
that humans created in the past.</b>

12:38.570 --> 12:39.650
<b>Humans did?</b>

12:39.650 --> 12:42.190
<b>Yes. A few thousand years ago, even.</b>

12:42.610 --> 12:45.200
<b>But what is it doing in a place like this?</b>

12:45.450 --> 12:46.200
<b><i>That is...</i></b>

12:46.620 --> 12:48.660
<b><i>the object of worship in this village.</i></b>

12:48.660 --> 12:49.870
<b>Pascal.</b>

12:50.080 --> 12:51.450
<b>Object of worship?</b>

12:51.450 --> 12:52.540
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

12:52.710 --> 12:55.500
<b><i>I have stopped fighting</i></b>

12:55.500 --> 12:58.000
<b><i>because I met the one you see here.</i></b>

12:58.630 --> 12:59.840
<b><i>It was...</i></b>

13:00.630 --> 13:02.920
<b><i>back when I was still on the battlefield.</i></b>

13:07.180 --> 13:09.510
<b><i>I had been blasted away,</i></b>

13:09.510 --> 13:11.520
<b><i>and found my way to this location.</i></b>

13:12.680 --> 13:15.390
<b><i>Peaceful and quiet.</i></b>

13:15.730 --> 13:19.110
<b><i>The air was different here from elsewhere.</i></b>

13:21.690 --> 13:24.530
<b>...ive... Li... e...</b>

13:24.740 --> 13:25.610
<b>Live!</b>

13:52.350 --> 13:55.980
<b><i>Even after that, I kept fighting.</i></b>

13:56.810 --> 14:00.310
<b><i>In fierce combat, one ally falls,</i></b>

14:00.310 --> 14:04.070
<b><i>then another ally, and another.</i></b>

14:04.490 --> 14:08.490
<b><i>A scene familiar to me,
being repeated for thousands of years.</i></b>

14:11.830 --> 14:13.790
<b><i>But at that moment,</i></b>

14:13.790 --> 14:18.250
<b><i>I felt "my own death"
for the first time in battle,</i></b>

14:18.830 --> 14:21.000
<b><i>and felt immense fear.</i></b>

14:25.300 --> 14:27.880
<b><i>Even after losing so many allies,</i></b>

14:28.260 --> 14:31.720
<b><i>I did not understand
that was a sad thing.</i></b>

14:32.140 --> 14:35.350
<b><i>I was simply inorganic, apathetic...</i></b>

14:36.430 --> 14:38.100
<b><i>And such a self...</i></b>

14:38.560 --> 14:40.690
<b><i>was more terrifying than anything else.</i></b>

14:41.440 --> 14:44.480
<b><i>That is why I...</i></b>

14:46.110 --> 14:49.860
<b>That has to simply be a bug or an error.</b>

14:50.200 --> 14:55.370
<b><i>You're right. I surely have gone insane.</i></b>

14:56.080 --> 14:58.870
<b><i>My other allies kept fighting,</i></b>

14:58.870 --> 15:02.420
<b><i>and before I knew it, I was all alone.</i></b>

15:03.170 --> 15:07.090
<b><i>However, I now have this village.</i></b>

15:07.920 --> 15:09.550
<b><i>After leaving the battlefield,</i></b>

15:09.550 --> 15:14.100
<b><i>I created this village together with others
who stopped fighting in a similar manner.</i></b>

15:14.430 --> 15:18.600
<b><i>My daily job now
is to take care of the children.</i></b>

15:18.600 --> 15:20.850
<b><i>Oh. Uncle Pascal.</i></b>

15:20.940 --> 15:22.810
<b><i>Hurray. Play with us.</i></b>

15:22.940 --> 15:24.940
<b><i>Read us books again.</i></b>

15:24.940 --> 15:26.900
<b><i>Yes, of course.</i></b>

15:26.900 --> 15:30.780
<b><i>When I'm done guiding the guests,
let's play together.</i></b>

15:30.780 --> 15:31.910
<b><i>Hurray.</i></b>

15:32.200 --> 15:34.780
<b><i>I found this. Found this.</i></b>

15:35.080 --> 15:38.620
<b><i>This is something called a "music box."</i></b>

15:38.620 --> 15:40.410
<b><i>Music box?</i></b>

15:40.410 --> 15:43.380
<b><i>When you wind up the spring like this...</i></b>

15:45.960 --> 15:46.710
<b><i>Whoa.</i></b>

15:46.710 --> 15:49.170
<b><i>What is this? Amazing. Beautiful.</i></b>

15:49.170 --> 15:51.760
<b><i>Let's have everyone listen to this.</i></b>

15:51.760 --> 15:55.010
<b><i>Oh. Give back. Give back.</i></b>

16:23.790 --> 16:29.300
<b><i>We have been severed
from the machine lifeform network.</i></b>

16:31.880 --> 16:32.840
<b><i>However...</i></b>

16:33.550 --> 16:37.390
<b><i>We have gained much in return.</i></b>

16:52.440 --> 16:53.610
<b>This is strange.</b>

16:54.450 --> 16:58.200
<b>Machine lifeforms are weapons
created for combat.</b>

16:58.620 --> 17:00.490
<b>They were created to kill us.</b>

17:01.250 --> 17:06.130
<b>Many allies died?
The same can be said for us as well.</b>

17:06.630 --> 17:11.630
<b>The androids that they killed count
in the thousands, even tens of thousands.</b>

17:11.840 --> 17:15.970
<b>And yet, they alone
say they stopped fighting.</b>

17:16.430 --> 17:19.260
<b>That's too selfish.</b>

17:20.640 --> 17:22.430
<b>It's just too selfish.</b>

17:23.770 --> 17:27.020
<b>And so many units like that
are gathered here.</b>

17:27.270 --> 17:30.860
<b>They finally separated themselves
from the network and became free.</b>

17:31.070 --> 17:32.030
<b>They're contradicting themselves.</b>

17:32.690 --> 17:35.450
<b><i>Survival rate decreases for individual units.</i></b>

17:35.450 --> 17:41.200
<b><i>Power is required from other units
for long-term stable activities.</i></b>

17:41.830 --> 17:46.170
<b>You can't live alone.
Not even machine lifeforms.</b>

17:46.960 --> 17:49.250
<b>You can't live alone.</b>

17:53.130 --> 17:54.420
<b><i>What was that just now?</i></b>

17:54.510 --> 17:55.760
<b>9S?</b>

17:56.130 --> 17:58.510
<b>Oh no, it's nothing.</b>

17:58.680 --> 18:01.600
<b>Um, so if I summarize...</b>

18:01.600 --> 18:04.980
<b>That means 2B,
you have a need for me as...</b>

18:05.640 --> 18:08.230
<b>Wait, I lied! Just kidding!
I didn't say anything.</b>

18:08.850 --> 18:12.780
<b>But I do wish it was that way.</b>

18:14.690 --> 18:17.490
<b>Shall we head back soon, 2B?</b>

18:17.570 --> 18:21.990
<b>Pod. Mark current location
on the map, and archive it.</b>

18:21.990 --> 18:22.910
<b><i>Affirmative.</i></b>

18:22.910 --> 18:26.790
<b>Huh? Our job is done here.
Why would you do that now?</b>

18:28.000 --> 18:29.540
<b>Because once we have peace...</b>

18:30.080 --> 18:33.130
<b>we'll be back here together
to buy T-shirts.</b>

18:36.630 --> 18:37.680
<b>Okay!</b>

18:37.930 --> 18:39.590
<b>Once we have peace.</b>

18:39.800 --> 18:41.430
<b>I'm sure it'll be soon.</b>

18:46.560 --> 18:48.350
<b><i>Oh, you shouldn't.</i></b>

18:48.600 --> 18:51.730
<b><i>Oh, everyone,
please be friendly to each other.</i></b>

18:51.900 --> 18:53.570
<b><i>What's going on with you?</i></b>

18:53.570 --> 18:54.730
<b><i>Give me a break.</i></b>

18:54.730 --> 18:56.490
<b><i>Mine. Mine.</i></b>

18:56.490 --> 18:58.110
<b><i>- Shut up.
- Let go of it.</i></b>

18:58.110 --> 19:02.950
<b><i>It's not good to keep things to yourself.
Let's all listen to it together, okay?</i></b>

19:02.950 --> 19:05.740
<b><i>No. Want. Want.</i></b>

19:06.040 --> 19:15.250
<b><i>Everyone, own item, own. Me, nothing.
Nothing. Talk, weird. Weird. Outcast.</i></b>

19:15.630 --> 19:19.220
<b><i>Outcast? That's not true.</i></b>

19:19.220 --> 19:20.220
<b><i>Lies.</i></b>

19:20.220 --> 19:23.390
<b><i>- Just give it back, moron.
- You're being mean.</i></b>

19:23.390 --> 19:25.930
<b><i>- Come on.
- Let go.</i></b>

19:25.930 --> 19:30.140
<b><i>Oh no, violence is bad. Everyone should be
friendly to each other.</i></b>

19:30.140 --> 19:32.770
<b><i>No.</i></b>

19:33.400 --> 19:34.690
<b><i>Now you’ve done it.</i></b>

19:42.490 --> 19:45.280
<b><i>Hate. Hate everyone.</i></b>

19:45.490 --> 19:48.870
<b>They stopped fighting,
but they still have disputes.</b>

19:49.040 --> 19:53.000
<b><i>These kinds of troubles have a high chance
of occurrence in a community.</i></b>

19:53.130 --> 19:57.670
<b><i>Each unit's objectives or gains clash,
creating a dispute.</i></b>

19:58.010 --> 20:01.970
<b>Back when they were weapons,
their only objective was to fight.</b>

20:01.970 --> 20:04.350
<b><i>- Now you did it. Damn it.
- Stop it.</i></b>

20:04.350 --> 20:06.310
<b>They're radicalizing more and more.</b>

20:06.600 --> 20:07.770
<b>If they keep going...</b>

20:08.390 --> 20:08.890
<b>Nine...</b>

20:09.770 --> 20:14.020
<b><i>Operator 21O to 9S.
This is your regularly scheduled contact.</i></b>

20:15.150 --> 20:17.690
<b><i>9S, come in.</i></b>

20:19.530 --> 20:21.240
<b>This is 9S.</b>

20:21.900 --> 20:24.370
<b>Nothing to report.</b>

20:27.370 --> 20:31.960
<b>Hey, Brother?
Why do we have to read books?</b>

20:32.210 --> 20:35.130
<b>Knowledge enriches existence.</b>

20:35.330 --> 20:38.380
<b>Why can't we just
transfer all this data over instantly?</b>

20:38.550 --> 20:43.010
<b>It doesn't enter your heart
unless you read it yourself.</b>

20:44.130 --> 20:45.510
<b>All right.</b>

20:45.800 --> 20:48.220
<b>You should read more books.</b>

20:48.220 --> 20:51.930
<b>I'm fine.
Because I have you, Brother.</b>

20:52.390 --> 20:53.270
<b>Eve.</b>

20:53.560 --> 20:55.600
<b>You should start calling me
"elder brother."</b>

20:55.600 --> 20:59.230
<b>Huh? Why are you saying that
so suddenly, Bro...</b>

21:00.780 --> 21:03.360
<b>Yes, Elder Brother.</b>

21:04.030 --> 21:05.570
<b>Good boy.</b>

22:41.090 --> 22:43.500
<b>POD 042 REPORTING TO ALL OF MANKIND.</b>

22:41.090 --> 22:43.500
<b>WE WILL NOW EXECUTE THE TASK
OF INTRODUCING THE MULTIPLE ENDINGS
FOR THE VIDEO GAME "NIER:AUTOMATA." OVER.</b>

22:44.420 --> 22:47.680
<b>PUPPET PLAY
NIER:AUTOMATA
“L3+R3”</b>

22:49.840 --> 22:50.890
<b>Yes, yes, hello.</b>

22:50.890 --> 22:55.810
<b>We are androids who fight for mankind day in
and day out, YoRHa No. 9 Type S AKA 9S and...</b>

22:55.810 --> 22:58.770
<b>Likewise, YoRHa No. 2 Type B AKA 2B.</b>

22:58.770 --> 23:02.520
<b>Actually, we YoRHa Soldiers
have an unbelievable secret function.</b>

23:02.520 --> 23:05.820
<b>I'm going to "secretly"
tell you viewers what it is.</b>

23:05.820 --> 23:08.240
<b>I'm sure you know what it is, right 2B?</b>

23:08.900 --> 23:14.080
<b>Hint. If we execute it, something big
will happen. The you-know-what.</b>

23:14.080 --> 23:15.200
<b>You can't mean...</b>

23:16.870 --> 23:20.170
<b>When I use this function,
I end up feeling a bit refreshed.</b>

23:17.450 --> 23:20.170
<b>PHEW</b>

23:22.840 --> 23:25.670
<b>I lost my skirt that has a radiator function.</b>

23:26.130 --> 23:28.050
<b>Let me join you guys!</b>

23:28.380 --> 23:32.470
<b>All right! Here goes, in all seriousness!</b>

23:32.470 --> 23:32.930
<b>Hold on, w—</b>

23:34.680 --> 23:37.430
<b>Emil caused his fusion reactor to go out of control,
turning the planet into a dead chunk of rock,
tumbling through the vast vacuum of an uncaring universe.</b>

23:38.140 --> 23:40.020
<b>TO BE CONTINUED</b>
